      id: 'mersenne-n9',
      type: 'narrative',
      content: {
        cn: '1648 年 9 月 1 日，我 60 岁，死在 Paris Place Royale 修道院 cell 里。死因是肺脓疡（肺部感染），医生开错刀，脓引流不畅，拖了几周，9 月 1 日清晨断气。临终前我让人把通信网最后一批未回的信件烧掉：「不要让别人看我答应过又没做的事。」\n\n这一天的同时性，1648 年，你必须放进 17 世纪欧洲大背景里读。\n\n1648 年 5 月，Westphalia 和约谈判进入决定阶段。1648 年 9 月 17 日（我死后 16 天）加 10 月 24 日，Westphalia 和约正式签订，结束 30 Years\' War（1618-1648 神圣罗马帝国境内 Catholic-Protestant 大战，外加法国、瑞典、西班牙介入）。\n\n30 Years\' War 死人数，史学家估算 4-8 百万平民死加 1-2 百万士兵阵亡。Careful framing：这个范围跨度大是因为 17 世纪人口统计不精，Geoffrey Parker 1990s 加 Peter Wilson 2009《Europe\'s Tragedy》给的现代估算。中间数大约 800 万。但你要把 abstract 数字落到具体地点。\n\n1631 年 5 月 20 日，Magdeburg 屠城。德意志中部 Lutheran 城市 25,000 平民。Tilly 帝国军（神圣罗马帝国加 Catholic 联盟）围城后破城，一夜屠 80% 人口，剩 5,000 人。整个 17 世纪欧洲单事件最大屠杀。这件事 1631 年震动全欧洲。Galileo 在 Arcetri、Descartes 在 Holland、我在 Paris cell 都听到消息，但没人能做什么。\n\n1648 年 9 月 1 日我死的时候，30 Years\' War 还没正式结束。我 1631 年 43 岁听到 Magdeburg 屠城，1648 年 60 岁死。这 17 年我夹在「写信给 Galileo 加 Descartes」跟「读 Magdeburg 屠 25,000 人」之间。\n\n这一点 careful framing：17 世纪欧洲的 Scientific Revolution 不是发生在和平时代，是发生在欧洲史上最血腥的宗教战争里。我 25 年的通信网，Paris-Florence-Hague-London，经常因为战线被切断加信使被抢加城市被围。我没死在战争里，但我所有的通信对象都活在战争阴影下。\n\n9 月 18 日 Pascal 完成 Puy-de-Dôme 实验。9 月 17 日和 10 月 24 日 Westphalia 签字。9 月 1 日我死。三件事 17 天内同步。但我没看到任何一件的结果。',
        en: '1 September 1648, at 60, I died in my cell at the Place Royale Minim convent in Paris. Cause: a lung abscess. The surgeon mis-cut, the pus did not drain, weeks of dragging illness; the morning of 1 September the breath stopped. At the end I had the last unanswered letters in my correspondence pile burned: "do not let people see what I promised and did not deliver."\n\nThe simultaneity of that one day, 1648, must be read against the European backdrop.\n\nMay 1648, the Westphalia peace negotiations entered their final phase. 17 September 1648 (16 days after my death) and 24 October, the Peace of Westphalia was formally signed, ending the Thirty Years\' War (1618-1648; Catholic-Protestant warfare across the Holy Roman Empire, with France, Sweden, and Spain in the field).\n\nDeath toll of the Thirty Years\' War. Historians estimate 4 to 8 million civilians plus 1 to 2 million soldiers. Careful framing: the wide range exists because 17th-century census records are poor. Geoffrey Parker in the 1990s and Peter Wilson in his 2009 Europe\'s Tragedy provide the modern figures. The midpoint is around 8 million. The abstract number must land on a specific place.\n\n20 May 1631, the sack of Magdeburg. A Lutheran city in central Germany, 25,000 civilians. Tilly\'s Imperial army (Holy Roman Empire plus the Catholic League) broke the siege; in one night 80% of the population was killed; only 5,000 survived. The largest single-event massacre in 17th-century Europe. The news shook the whole continent in 1631. Galileo at Arcetri, Descartes in Holland, I in my Paris cell, we all heard. None of us could do anything.\n\nWhen I died on 1 September 1648, the Thirty Years\' War was not yet formally over. I had heard about the sack of Magdeburg in 1631 at age 43; I died in 1648 at age 60. For seventeen years I sat between "writing to Galileo and Descartes" and "reading that 25,000 were killed in Magdeburg."\n\nCareful framing: the 17th-century Scientific Revolution did not happen in peacetime. It happened during the bloodiest religious war in European history. My 25 years of correspondence, Paris-Florence-The Hague-London, were repeatedly cut by front lines, by couriers being robbed, by cities under siege. I did not die in the war. But every one of my correspondents lived under its shadow.\n\nOn 18 September Pascal completed the Puy-de-Dôme experiment. On 17 September and 24 October Westphalia was signed. On 1 September I died. Three things, all within 17 days. I saw none of them.',
      },
      deliverGoal: 'N9 1648.9.1 死 60 岁肺脓疡 + 临终烧未回信件 + 同年 Westphalia (9.17 + 10.24) + 30 Years\' War 死 ~800 万 careful framing (Parker 1990s + Wilson 2009 4-8M 范围) + 1631.5.20 Magdeburg 25,000 屠 80% (Tilly 帝国军) + 17 年我夹在写信跟读屠杀之间 + 17c Scientific Revolution 不是和平时代是宗教战争里 + 9.1 死 9.17 Westphalia 9.18 Pascal Puy-de-Dôme 三件事 17 天内',
      engagementHook: '我 25 年写信，同时 25 年读 Magdeburg 屠 25,000 人。Scientific Revolution 不是和平时代发生的，是欧洲史上最血腥宗教战争里发生的。这跟你印象里的「科学革命温和岁月」差多远？',
      expectsRealAnswer: false,
